3. **Do not cite.** Quarantine `delta_new_minus_v1_alias_complete_cases = 0.8123` and its bootstrap CI from all manuscripts, slides, and synthesis-gate summaries until a v3 re-run clears both the (fixed) sanity gate and the full-population undefined-cell blocker.
4. **If re-run (new prereg + re-audit, per stop rules):** resolve F3 (family ground truth vs stage-only carrier construction) before computing Δdiag — otherwise the primary diagnosability metric compares labels to artifacts that do not carry the labelled operation; also pin the binding P1 ordered-list hash (F6) and state the coverage ceiling (F4: 18.8% signature-invariant transpositions) in the claim itself.
